                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d76c36ec-6750-4a32-a4bf-85eacca1dd4e",
                        "entry_id": "d011569e-a8df-3e71-be06-a72b4ddb8c32",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "fantasies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c9b01e31-2c08-3660-b123-83255b26de87",
                        "entry_id": "d011569e-a8df-3e71-be06-a72b4ddb8c32",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Genre anglo-saxon proche du merveilleux rattaché aux littératures de l'imaginaire qui décrit des univers créés de toute pièce parfois reliés au nôtre et dotés de leurs propres géographie, Histoire, langues, environnement et peuples où le surnaturel, et notamment la magie, appartient au domaine du normal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4287cd85-94d5-4f54-b9cd-195f3255fccf",
                                "sense_id": "c9b01e31-2c08-3660-b123-83255b26de87",
                                "text": "C'est vrai du genre littéraire de la fantasie pratiquement en bloc : seuls les tenants du mal y entretiennent des systèmes d'administration. On pourrait d'ailleurs passer en revue une par une les principales caractéristiques de la fantasie et voir en chacune d'elles la négation précise d'un aspect de la bureaucratie :\n– Les mondes de la fantasie sont souvent marqués par une division absolue entre le bien et le mal (ou, dans le meilleur des cas, entre un bien ambigu et le mal absolu), ce qui implique l'existence de forces entre lesquelles la seule relation possible est la guerre."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85be1acd-ebf1-4a5a-9bf5-c510541d9f2a",
                        "source_entry_id": "d011569e-a8df-3e71-be06-a72b4ddb8c32",
                        "source_sense_id": "c9b01e31-2c08-3660-b123-83255b26de87",
                        "target_lang_word": "fantasy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fantasy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a14484c-61b7-3967-80ec-a75916bd7b21",
                                        "entry_id": "19d88710-af02-3672-a05b-c96c8b0b1dcc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which comes from one's imagination."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77bbbae4-23b1-460f-b3c3-551541a69fc1",
                                                "sense_id": "5a14484c-61b7-3967-80ec-a75916bd7b21",
                                                "text": "Is not this something more than fantasy?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "702dbfb0-db70-4617-a044-ad8704ed49b0",
                                                "sense_id": "5a14484c-61b7-3967-80ec-a75916bd7b21",
                                                "text": "A thousand fantasies / Begin to throng into my memory."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9d9f24e-c913-4986-a23c-3a03dd976974",
                                                "sense_id": "5a14484c-61b7-3967-80ec-a75916bd7b21",
                                                "text": "The whole position was so tremendous and so absolutely unearthly, that I believe it actually lulled our sense of terror, but to this hour I often see it in my dreams, and at its mere phantasy wake up covered with cold sweat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3fdc3e7-c890-4986-9f0b-e10e469923a6",
                                                "sense_id": "5a14484c-61b7-3967-80ec-a75916bd7b21",
                                                "text": "Try as hard as it can, empirical science cannot come up with a naturalistic explanation; it can only slip into fantasies that make scientists feel good because they are in harmony with their opinions, prejudices, and unconscious assumptions about the nature of reality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "633188e6-782c-31c6-8c9e-1b88d8b916ac",
                                        "entry_id": "19d88710-af02-3672-a05b-c96c8b0b1dcc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The literary genre generally dealing with themes of magic and the supernatural, imaginary worlds and creatures, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90d6dff3-3854-36ff-891f-7f49f619a884",
                                        "entry_id": "19d88710-af02-3672-a05b-c96c8b0b1dcc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fantastical design."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "355eb6d8-fd39-49c2-b794-74508672f94f",
                                                "sense_id": "90d6dff3-3854-36ff-891f-7f49f619a884",
                                                "text": "Embroidered with fantasies and flourishes of gold thread."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3379de8b-25b6-31fd-9b5f-776eef47a33b",
                                        "entry_id": "19d88710-af02-3672-a05b-c96c8b0b1dcc",
